        "created_at": "2018-09-14T17:33:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been looking at some story concepts based on kinda combining existing Sentinels egyptian myth with more real world sources.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>One of my current heroes is a anesiac young woman from another universe who remembers her name as Raetchel. She Has fire powers and can fly on litteral wings of flame, but has no idea where or why she has powers. and there are lots of background story elements that i love that i'd have to work with my GM on.</p>",
